+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a synthetic 5,000-record store, measured end to end from process start to
+exit over 300 hook invocations, the `SessionStart` p50 was **16.398 ms** before
+`PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. The change that removed it
+also replaced the FTS row-count query with the trigger-maintained `fts_rows`
+counter and added the `record.body` length `CHECK`, so the measurement does not
+isolate the cost of any one of those changes.
+
+After the read path switched to the recorded quick-check result and the
+trigger-maintained FTS counter, the measured `SessionStart` p50 was **1.032 ms**
+on the same 5,000-record, 300-invocation benchmark.
